---
import SiteShell from "../components/site-shell.astro"
import Main from "../layouts/main.astro"
---

<Main
  title="Design & Development Services | Basilpot"
  description="Custom design and development for businesses, travel companies and ecommerce brands across time zones, plus migration, maintenance and marketing."
  serviceType="Design and development"
>
  <SiteShell>
    <article>
      <h1>Design and development</h1>
      <p>
        We design, build and support websites and web systems for businesses,
        travel companies and ecommerce brands, including teams across Latin
        America.
      </p>
      <section>
        <h2>Remote teams, international reach</h2>
        <p>
          We work across time zones with businesses and brands in Latin America
          and South America. Project communication stays direct, with written
          plans and clear handoffs.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Business websites</h2>
        <p>
          Custom websites shaped around the business, its content and the people
          it needs to reach. Work can include information architecture, design,
          development, content management and enquiry flows.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Travel websites</h2>
        <p>
          Travel websites with structured trips, day-by-day itineraries,
          destinations, editorial content and enquiries.
        </p>
        <p><a href="/travel">Read about travel websites</a>.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Ecommerce websites</h2>
        <p>
          Custom online stores with product catalogues, collections, content and
          storefronts designed around the brand.
        </p>
        <p><a href="/ecommerce">Read about ecommerce websites</a>.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Website migration</h2>
        <p>
          Rebuilds and platform migrations that preserve useful content, plan
          redirects and improve structure without carrying unnecessary legacy
          code forward.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Maintenance</h2>
        <p>
          Ongoing technical support, content changes, performance work and
          improvements for websites we build and systems we know well.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Media and marketing</h2>
        <p>
          Digital media and marketing support grounded in the business, its
          audience and measurable needs.
        </p>
        <p><a href="/media-and-marketing">View media and marketing work</a>.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Start a project</h2>
        <p><a href="/contact">Tell us what you need</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </SiteShell>
</Main>
